  "before_entry": {
    "id": "M26",
    "title_zh": "认知发展与取得的组合解释",
    "title_en": "Cognitive development and acquired compositional interpretation",
    "claim_zh": "取得的组合操作进入沟通、分节、绑定及新使用；行动与访问记录改变后续经历。后得来源关系现重释旧命名并进入组合回应。经验覆盖与保留边界、错误确信及历史倒推失败保留，完整认知目标未完成。",
    "claim_en": "Acquired composition enters communication, grouping, binding and new use; activity and access records change later encounters. Later source learning now reinterprets retained naming and enters compositional response. Empirical coverage/retention limits, mistaken confidence and backward-transfer failure remain; the full cognitive goal is incomplete.",
    "scope_zh": "取得25项定理／52项审计；构造37／65；传递27／45；分节23／51；绑定23／41；行动场景16／29；经历选择22／46；回溯来源绑定20／36（最新284项继承定理／513项审计分列）。空间、类别、目录、准则、初次巡查与合作命名仍有给定；新组合另要求渠道、校准、路径／扰动范围及向过去的适用性，非完整成本账。经验：36人1,508次命名，三秒467次其他注视而零所指，另45次两者零，五秒前类393次；75人451试次主动−配对−1.34个百分点，95%区间[−10.38,+7.69]不证等效。下一连接为来源—内容保持与历史范围的形成；心理实现、演化及意识未完成。",
    "scope_en": "Acquisition 25 theorems/52 audits; formation 37/65; transmission 27/45; grouping 23/51; binding 23/41; enacted scenes 16/29; encounter selection 22/46; retrospective source binding 20/36 (latest 284 inherited theorems/513 audits separate). Spatial/category laws, catalogue, criterion, initial surveys and cooperative naming retain supplied premises; the new composition additionally requires channel identity, calibration, route/fault coverage and backward applicability, without complete cost accounting. Empirical: 36 infants/1,508 events, 467 three-second other-without-target gaze cases plus 45 zero on both; 393 former cases at five seconds. For 75 participants/451 trials, Curiosity−Yoked −1.34 percentage points, 95% interval [−10.38,+7.69], not equivalence. Next: formation of source–content retention and historical scope. Psychological realization, evolution and consciousness remain incomplete.",
